{:edb/db-before-t 1905 :edb/db-after-t 1906 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535218 50 #inst "2026-10-08T19:48:03.895Z" 13194139535218 true] [17592186096576 1020 #edb/ref 17592186338150 13194139535218 true] [17592186096576 1020 #edb/ref 17592186338157 13194139535218 true] [17592186096577 1020 #edb/ref 17592186338160 13194139535218 true] [17592186096577 1020 #edb/ref 17592186338164 13194139535218 true] [17592186097136 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535218 true] [17592186097136 1100 "${\\int }_{0}^{3}\\frac{1}{3}{e}^{x/3}\\,\\text{d}x=$" 13194139535218 true] [17592186097136 1100 "What is $\\displaystyle \\int_{0}^{3}\\frac{1}{3}e^{x/3}dx$?" 13194139535218 false] [17592186097136 1145 "If we let $u=\\frac{x}{3},$ then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{3}\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}u=\\frac{1}{3}\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nComputing our limits of integration, we get the following:\n\n| $x$ | $0$ | $3$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $0$ | $1$ |\n\nThen, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{3}\\frac{1}{3}{e}^{x/3}\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{3}{e}^{x/3}\\cdot \\frac{1}{3}\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{e}^{u}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =({e}^{u}){|}_{0}^{1} \\\\  & ={e}^{1}-{e}^{0} \\\\  & =e-1\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535218 true] [17592186338150 1017 #edb/ref 17592186338151 13194139535218 true] [17592186338150 1089 "q-30922" 13194139535218 true] [17592186338150 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535218 true] [17592186338150 1100 "Evaluate the integral ${\\int }_{0}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡4}-5{e}^{-2x}\\,\\text{d}x.$" 13194139535218 true] [17592186338150 1113 #uuid "ca6888b6-2f58-5a99-82de-12bf27a8489d" 13194139535218 true] [17592186338150 1145 "If we let $u=-2x,$ then,\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=-2\\,⟹\\,-\\frac{1}{2}\\text{d}u=\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nComputing our limits of integration, we get the following:\n\n| $x$ | $0$ | $\\operatorname{ln}⁡4$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $0$ | $-2\\operatorname{ln}⁡4$ |\n\nThen, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡4}-5{e}^{-2x}\\,\\text{d}x & =-5{\\int }_{0}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡4}{e}^{-2x}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-5{\\int }_{0}^{-2\\operatorname{ln}⁡4}{e}^{u}(-\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡({4}^{-2})}{e}^{u}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{2}({e}^{u}){|}_{0}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡({4}^{-2})} \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{2}({e}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡({4}^{-2})}-{e}^{0}) \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{2}({4}^{-2}-1) \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{2}(\\frac{1}{16}-1) \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{2}\\cdot (-\\frac{15}{16}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{75}{32}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535218 true] [17592186338151 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338152 13194139535218 true] [17592186338151 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338153 13194139535218 true] [17592186338151 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338154 13194139535218 true] [17592186338151 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338155 13194139535218 true] [17592186338151 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338156 13194139535218 true] [17592186338151 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535218 true] [17592186338151 1041 "selection" 13194139535218 true] [17592186338151 1104 #edb/ref 17592186338154 13194139535218 true] [17592186338151 1110 #uuid "cb84f938-5705-5e86-84f2-522a195e1d2b" 13194139535218 true] [17592186338152 1034 "-\\frac{25}{8}" 13194139535218 true] [17592186338152 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535218 true] [17592186338152 1111 #uuid "770464f3-24c4-5d37-94d7-df7dbb3986ff" 13194139535218 true] [17592186338153 1034 "-\\frac{25}{16}" 13194139535218 true] [17592186338153 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535218 true] [17592186338153 1111 #uuid "69adfe94-671f-5332-bb00-4248ca3371a2" 13194139535218 true] [17592186338154 1034 "-\\frac{75}{32}" 13194139535218 true] [17592186338154 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535218 true] [17592186338154 1111 #uuid "da099e55-8447-560f-9cd1-14fdbb25ac3e" 13194139535218 true] [17592186338155 1034 "-\\frac{15}{16}" 13194139535218 true]